---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="学员风采 - 满分虎体育">
  <section class="page-hero" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-accent), #00E676);">
    <div class="container"><h1>学员风采</h1></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">训练瞬间</h2>
      <div class="gallery-grid">
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="/images/students/students-running.jpg" alt="学员操场跑步训练" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="gallery-caption">1000米/800米耐力跑训练</span>
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="/images/students/students-jump-rope.jpg" alt="小区内跳绳训练" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="gallery-caption">社区跳绳训练</span>
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="/images/students/students-standing-jump.jpg" alt="立定跳远训练" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="gallery-caption">立定跳远动作训练</span>
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="/images/students/students-situps.jpg" alt="仰卧起坐训练" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="gallery-caption">仰卧起坐核心训练</span>
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="/images/students/students-volleyball.jpg" alt="排球垫球训练" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="gallery-caption">排球垫球选考训练</span>
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="/images/students/students-football.jpg" alt="足球射门训练" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="gallery-caption">足球射门选考训练</span>
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="/images/students/students-stretching.jpg" alt="热身拉伸训练" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="gallery-caption">课前热身拉伸</span>
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="/images/students/students-coaching.jpg" alt="教练指导训练" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="gallery-caption">教练一对一动作纠正</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="background:var(--c-surface);">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">学员故事</h2>
      <div class="stories-grid">
        <div class="story-card">
          <img src="/images/students/student-growth.jpg" alt="学员小雅成长故事" class="story-image" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="story-body">
            <h3>从体育勉强及格到中考满分，我长高了8厘米</h3>
            <p class="story-tag">小雅 · 初三学员 · 训练18个月</p>
            <p>刚来满分虎的时候，我800米跑5分10秒，立定跳远只有1.55米，体育成绩一直在及格线附近晃。更让我爸妈担心的是，我比班里女生矮半个头，体质弱，换季就感冒。</p>
            <p>一年半的系统训练，变化远不止体育成绩——我的800米跑进了3分30秒，立定跳远达到1.90米，中考体育拿了满分。更让我惊喜的是，训练期间我长高了8厘米，感冒少了，上课注意力也比以前集中了。</p>
            <p>现在想想，当初只是想别让体育拖后腿，没想到身体素质全面提升了。整个人自信多了，走路都挺着腰板。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="story-card">
          <img src="/images/students/student-handball.jpg" alt="手球专业学员故事" class="story-image" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="story-body">
            <h3>手球少年：体育特长让他走得更远</h3>
            <p class="story-tag">小李 · 初三学员 · 手球专项训练2年</p>
            <p>小李从初一开始跟着满分虎训练，本来只是为了中考体育拿个好成绩。教练发现他上肢力量和爆发力突出，协调性好，建议他尝试手球专项训练。</p>
            <p>两年下来，小李不仅中考体育轻松满分，手球水平也达到了专业队选拔标准。更重要的是，长期的专业训练让他的身体素质远超同龄人——身高从入学时的1.62米长到了1.78米，作息规律了，学习效率也提高了，文化课成绩反而比训练前还好。</p>
            <p>现在小李已经凭借手球特长考上了理想的重点大学，体育不只是分数，更成了他人生的一张牌。满分虎的手球教练是前国家队运动员，在专业指导和升学规划方面经验丰富。对于有体育特长的孩子来说，坚持训练带来的不仅是体考分数，更是一条与众不同的发展路径。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">荣誉墙</h2>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="placeholder" style="min-height:180px;">🏆 荣誉证书/奖杯1</div>
        <div class="placeholder" style="min-height:180px;">🏆 荣誉证书/奖杯2</div>
        <div class="placeholder" style="min-height:180px;">🏆 荣誉证书/奖杯3</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero { color: #fff; padding: 48px 0; text-align: center; }
  .page-hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }

  .gallery-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .gallery-item {
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }

  .gallery-item:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .gallery-item img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .gallery-caption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,0.7));
    color: #fff;
    padding: 24px 12px 10px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .stories-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .story-card {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }

  .story-image {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top center;
    display: block;
  }

  .story-body {
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .story-body h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .story-tag {
    color: var(--c-primary);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .story-body p {
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .story-body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .gallery-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
    .stories-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
